      "created_at": "2025-09-25T11:31:26.109Z",
      "cooked": "<p>For transactions like Sales Order, Quotation, Sales Invoice etc I have created my own method for currency exchange. Whenever user selects any currency I am making my own api call to fetch the exchange rates.</p>\n<p>But along with my own method core method of frappe is also being called to fetch the exchange rates from Currency Exchange List.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/a/8adfbf37a4f582f49a70162b8d912be23edad4c7_2_690x24.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"jOxgwz0TSVFKSxqO2Txio8ySalp\" width=\"690\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/a/8adfbf37a4f582f49a70162b8d912be23edad4c7_2_690x24.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/a/8adfbf37a4f582f49a70162b8d912be23edad4c7_2_1035x36.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/a/8adfbf37a4f582f49a70162b8d912be23edad4c7_2_1380x48.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"2E3035\"></p>\n<p>Here I have attached the screenshot you can see. First api call is from my custom app and another one is from frappe.</p>\n<p>My goal is to override the method and only my api should be called whenever Currency is selected.</p>",
